{"id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","zh":"列车-轨道-基础结构","en":"Train-track-substructure","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","definition_zh":"由列车、轨道和轨下基础结构共同组成的动力相互作用系统。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","zh":"列车-轨道-基础结构","en":"Train-track-substructure","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H82e8d224897b77eae14b","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 徐磊等（2023）"},{"id":"Ccdf723abaf58f0f2bc1e","zh":"列车—轨道—基础结构","en":"train–track–substructure","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","group_id":"H82e8d224897b77eae14b","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学 · Xu等（2023）"},{"id":"Ce43338af3472af2a466d","zh":"列车—轨道—基础结构","en":"train–track–substructure","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","group_id":"H82e8d224897b77eae14b","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学 · Xu（2022）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Db6f1ede16ed67dddd415","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"列车-轨道-基础结构"},{"id":"Df0868fdf2592311a8d22","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"Train-track-substructure"}],"sources":{"P123":{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S3191a419fc61d30540e3","source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"摘要:铁路工程混凝土结构疲劳损伤演化的数值实现是列车-轨道-基础结构系统动态性能预测的重要基础。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S70d1fe859431d8cd8706","source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学基本原理,引入混凝土疲劳损伤本构和砂浆黏弹性-疲劳本构,基于已建立的列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用模型为基础,在铁路工程系统动力学框架内建立了列车循环作用下无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化计算模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sb8781c4e7ecf6ddb57b9","source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"Numerical r